          "type": "text",
          "text": "Student designers considered a strict material budget while preparing a capacity check for the evacuation centre supply bin. Supply packages are counted before every emergency exercise. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A cone has radius 4 cm and perpendicular height 18 cm. Find its volume in cm³, correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
